  source_lineage: building-founding-team.md
  notes: >-
    Colombia's first ReFi node, launched April 2023 with two founders (named
    in the article and its cited source: Tereza Bízková and Juan Giraldo),
    growing to a roughly seven-person team and ~150-person community within
    months. Cited as the article's worked example of starting tiny and
    growing through partnerships with existing local organizations
    (PlatoHedro, impactMarket) rather than building from scratch. Named
    individuals are reproduced here only as already publicly cited in the
    article's own source (a public Medium interview); see the companion
    public-use-boundary object for reuse guidance.
